<p>  Mitsubishi			  49  down 67.8 percent</p>
<p>General Motors' February car sales included 485 Cavaliers sold by Toyota.</p>
<p>Of the February total, sales of vehicles produced by overseas units of Japanese makers totalled 6,132, down 30.8 percent from a year earlier.</p>
<p>The February total included 1,245 Nissan AD commercial vans made in Mexico, against six the year before.</p>
